WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:04.710
In 1647, a catechism
opened with one question:

2
00:00:04.760 --> 00:00:07.470
what is the chief end of man?

3
00:00:07.520 --> 00:00:12.380
Centuries earlier, Augustine wrote that
our heart is restless until it rests in

4
00:00:12.430 --> 00:00:13.430
God.

5
00:00:13.480 --> 00:00:17.680
And many Christians pray and work
for God's kingdom here on earth.

6
00:00:17.730 --> 00:00:20.820
So what is a Christian's
life actually for?

7
00:00:20.870 --> 00:00:23.250
And which purpose matters most?

8
00:00:23.300 --> 00:00:27.710
In this mission, you'll explore what
Christians mean by glorifying God,

9
00:00:27.760 --> 00:00:30.020
and by preparing for judgement.

10
00:00:30.070 --> 00:00:34.170
Then you'll weigh up the case that
one purpose should come first.

11
00:00:34.220 --> 00:00:37.510
Your mission: weigh up
what Christian life is for,

12
00:00:37.560 --> 00:00:39.550
and which purpose matters most.
